+
+/**
+ * struct hx_newlog - what a contact looked like at the moment it was born.
+ *
+ * A ghost and a fingertip both arrive as "a new touch"; they differ in area,
+ * integrated signal and whether they sat on the grid border.  Keeping the
+ * last few makes that difference readable after the fact.
